LocFriendlyName="Jump Pack"
LocLongDescription="Fire the jump pack and land anywhere within 14 tiles, over walls, rooftops and enemies alike. Costs one action and does not end the turn: jump, then strike. 2-turn cooldown."
LocHelpText="Jump to any tile within 14 tiles, ignoring terrain. One action, does not end the turn. 2-turn cooldown."
