LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet/> Jump to any visible tile within 14 tiles, ignoring terrain and height.<br/><Bullet/> Costs one action and does not end the turn, so you can jump and then attack.<br/><Bullet/> 2-turn cooldown.<br/>"
